  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SvKLEgB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1000\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/985671?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftinted-grass%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ZwO3amOU?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Grass&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcGPE3mktFe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1141743994154528768?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;label=MineColonies: Dimesnional Adventure&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"27\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>我的项目</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecolonies-dimensional-adventure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/852146?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=MineColonies: 维度冒险&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1098989?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=MineColonies: 方块派对&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/wdfIaSqz?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=MineColonies: 方块派对&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/979514?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Cloche创意工坊&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mbekts9X?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Cloche创意工坊&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/994223?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=染色火把&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mc1hqaaO?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=染色火把&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1009078?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=染色染料&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/77VVvOOe?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=染色染料&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1037808?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=染色沙砾&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/d72EAPUQ?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=染色沙砾&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1164785?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=染色木板&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rDPwULcT?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=染色木板&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>你是否在玩Minecraft时想过...要是能把草方块染成建筑需要的颜色该多好？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>现在梦想成真了！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>隆重推出——</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>染色草方块模组!!!!!</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组允许你将染料与中心放置的草方块合成，改变草方块的颜色。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>本模组配方需要染色染料模组支持!!!!!</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G3q9NdB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1000\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>青色草方块 = 绿色染料 + 蓝色染料</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AjftGuj.jpg\" width=\"343\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>伽马射线草 = 蓝色染料 + 棕色染料</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hwDUoRM.jpg\" width=\"332\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>以上是部分示例！</p>\n</div>",
